OL,3,AHead-on collision between bus and lorry
OL,4,Ain Brazil kills more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 23 people, among them two
OL,7,Fchildren, have been killed and another
OL,8,Ffive injured in a head-on collision
OL,9,Fbetween a minibus and a lorry in
OL,10,Fsouthern Brazil, highway police say.
OL,12,FThe crash happened early on Wednesday
OL,13,Flocal time on the BR-373 highway in the
OL,14,Fsouthern state of Parana.
OL,16,FLocal media reported that the minibus
OL,17,Fbelonged to the health authorities of
OL,18,Fthe nearby city of Imbituva and was
OL,19,Ftransporting patients and their
OL,20,Frelatives to health appointments in
OL,21,FPonta Grossa, some 60km (36 miles)
OL,22,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
