OL,3,AHead-on collision between bus and lorry
OL,4,Ain Brazil kills more than 20
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have opened an
OL,7,Finvestigation to determine what may
OL,8,Fhave caused the two vehicles to crash
OL,9,Finto each other.
